# SELECT ALL INVADERS (セレクト・オール・インベーダー) - vocal score
# Synth2 score notation: notes are PITCH DURATION LYRIC; '+' = next syllable of the word, '[ph ph]' = phonemes.
# Every section is placed with '@ <beat>' (bar k starts at beat 4*(k-1)); '|' marks bar lines.
# Chords and sections: SPEC.md. Lyrics: lyrics.md.
# One job per track: the lines (AI, Aliens, Crowd), the lead's calls in other voices' sections (AI Answer),
# the ad-libs (AI Adlib, Alien Adlib: sound words, interjections, the laugh, the stutters), the chants
# (Alien Chant, Alien Chant 2) and the gang shouts (Crowd Shout). An ad-lib is never written inside a line:
# it would be sung as part of it (glided into, breathed onto, its repeats all different).
# examples/select_all_invaders/vocals.py derives the AI Double, the Harmony, Crowd 2 / Crowd 3,
# Crowd Shout 2 / Crowd Shout 3 and the aliens' "fan voice" chop from these tracks (apply_vocal_production),
# then gives every kind of sound a track of its own, with its role and its cast (apply_arrangement).
# The song is in E minor (F# minor from bar 113): the key the neural voice sings it best in.
# engine: auto = the neural engine where its models are installed, the formant engine where they are not.
title: Select All Invaders
tempo: 168
time: 4/4
key: E minor
engine: auto

# =====================================================================================================
# AI: the deadpan, machine-tuned idol (Pinocchio-P style). Mostly E4-B4, chorus peaks C5 (D5 / F#5 in
# the final chorus). Patter on 8ths/16ths, repeated notes, octave jumps on the joke words.
# Only the lead's lines: its calls are on AI Answer, its sound words and stutters on AI Adlib.
# =====================================================================================================
track: AI voice=nova style=robotic lang=en role=lead gain=0 pan=0 reverb=0.25

